# AI Technology Intelligence Scout

This Streamlit app helps users search and detect suitable technologies using technology scouting, horizon scanning, and investment evaluation.

## Features

- Search technology options
- Match technologies with business needs
- Score technology readiness
- Evaluate lifecycle stage, TRL, risk, vendor stability, and pilot evidence
- Show related references and external links
- Recommend Explore, Pilot, Scale, or Avoid

## How to Run Locally

```bash
pip install -r requirements.txt
streamlit run app.py
